  "content": "<h1><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/Ut43Lym.png\" alt=\"標題\"/></h1>\n<center><h5 style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong> \n<a href=\"https://discord.gg/2CUh6gMuCt\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/1027252425960198165?color=5b6ee1&amp;label=Discord&amp;style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=discord&amp;logoColor=white\" alt=\"Discord\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://patreon.com/MarsThePlanet\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/endpoint.svg?url=https%3A%2F%2Fshieldsio-patreon.vercel.app%2Fapi%3Fusername%3DMarsThePlanet%26type%3Dpatrons&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"在 Patreon 上支持我\" /></a> \n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/laser-bridges-doors\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/curseforge/dt/776337?color=F16436&amp;logo=curseforge&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=Curseforge&amp;style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"CurseForge\" /></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/laser-bridges-and-doors\" ><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/modrinth/dt/laser-bridges-and-doors?style=for-the-badge&amp;logo=modrinth&amp;logoColor=white&amp;label=modrinth&amp;color=00AF5C\" alt=\"Modrinth\" /></a>\n</strong></h5></center>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5NxocZK.gif\" alt=\"\"/>\n<br>此模組引入了未來風格的雷射橋樑、門和柵欄，當雷射源方塊被紅石信號啟動時，這些結構便會形成。</p></center>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/C17yBiD.gif\" alt=\"\"/>\n<br>它們的長度取決於紅石信號強度，並會動態更新。</p></center>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VsMln86.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"/> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/uFErCaY.gif\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"/>\n<br>你可以手持染料點擊雷射源方塊，或使用發射器來為其染色。</p></center>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VX4VIHg.png\" alt=\"\"/></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/9qpoRLo.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"/> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/yZ8J54O.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"411\"/>\n<br>要合成雷射源方塊，請將玻璃方塊和 7 個鐵錠圍繞終界水晶擺放在合成格中。你可以將雷射源方塊放入合成格來合成雷射柵欄源方塊，且這個轉換是雙向的。</p></center>\n<details>\n<summary><strong>設定</strong></summary>\n<p>你可以直接在遊戲內設定此模組，或編輯遊戲資料夾中的 JSON 檔案 <code>config/laserbridges.json</code>。</p>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>max_length</b> - 全功率雷射源方塊所產生雷射的最大長度。所有其他長度皆以此數值計算，預設值為 15。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><b>blocks_cut_through_by_lasers</b> - 可被雷射取代的方塊列表。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/VMhMBQw.png\" alt=\"\"/></p>\n</center>\n</details>\n<center><p style=\"text-align: center;\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/JNZ2GMV.png\"/>\n<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/deimos-fabric-forge-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/83sD0W8.png\"/></a>\n<a href=\"https://modrinth.com/mod/deimos\" rel=\"nofollow\">\n<img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/j2GIPnt.png\"/></a>\n</p></center>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/marstheplanet\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/rJIRiP5.png\" /></a></p>",
